# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# StatementSense — Environment Variables Reference
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit the actual .env file to GitHub.

# ── Gemini AI (used by FastAPI backend engines) ──
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# ── Google Calendar OAuth (used by CalendarSense) ──
# Place credentials.json and token.json in the project root.
# These are git-ignored for security.

# ── Google Maps / Places API (used by CalendarSense v2) ──
# Required for searching real alternatives at travel destinations.
# Enable "Places API (New)" and "Maps JavaScript API" in Google Cloud Console.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your-google-maps-api-key-here
